# The build context is the instance's build folder. Without this file the two
# filestore copies update_docker_odoo.py keeps there (the docker cp backup and
# its .bak rotation) are shipped to the daemon on every build — gigabytes per
# build for a large instance.
filestore-backup/
release.file-*
# Backups odoo_build_cache.py writes before patching the Dockerfile
Dockerfile.bak_*
__pycache__/
*.log
*.tmp
